# Build-time config for the deployed site.
#
# These two values are PUBLIC by design. Vite compiles them into the
# JavaScript bundle, so anyone visiting the site can read them in devtools
# either way — they are not secrets. The database is protected by row-level
# security and the edge functions, not by hiding this key. The private
# service_role key is never used in the browser and is not here.
#
# Forking this project? Replace both values with your own Supabase project,
# or delete this file and set the variables in your host instead.

